1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:07,420
Ca Mau Land

2
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:14,020
<color=orange><b>Ca Mau</b></color> is rainy monsoon land.

3
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:22,570
In March, April, when sunny, suddenly rain pours down right there.

4
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:31,950
Heavy rain pours for a while then clears. In rain often whirlwind rises.

5
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:42,170
On this land, lone trees can hardly withstand sky's anger.

6
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:59,530
Barringtonia and fuchsia must grow in bunches; roots must be long, must be planted deep in ground.

7
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:09,970
Most is mangrove. Mangrove grows densely.

8
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:20,310
Houses built along canal banks, under rows of green mangroves.

9
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:32,280
From this house to that house must climb bridge made of mangrove trunk...

10
00:01:34,130 --> 00:01:40,370
Living in <color=orange><b>Ca Mau</b></color>, people must be very resourceful.

11
00:01:41,930 --> 00:01:56,800
Ancestral martial spirit is passed down to develop and protect this tip of Fatherland.

